  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PotatoEurope Trade mission with Plateau State stakeholders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">When the project results are achieved, Nigerian potato producers will gain direct access to high-quality Dutch inputs, technology, and market knowledge, boosting yields and post-harvest quality. This will enable sustainable trade flows between Nigeria and Europe, with improved value chain linkages and export readiness. Ultimately, it positions Nigeria as an emerging player in the global potato sector, fostering local jobs and food system resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
